        <mxCell id="CMP1" value="Where the 3 platforms differ (Phase 1 output):&#10;Solace     -&gt;  branchName=&#x27;solace/onboarding&#x27;     {solaceJson, filePath}                     — 1 file:  solace-automation/config/3pl/&lt;slug&gt;.json&#10;MuleSoft  -&gt;  branchName=&#x27;mulesoft/onboarding&#x27;  {mulesoftYaml: 1-4 of app/dev/tst/prod.yaml, filePaths} — only the file(s) actually changed: mulesoft-automation/config/&lt;slug&gt;/*.yaml&#10;BTP         -&gt;  branchName=&#x27;btp/onboarding&#x27;         {btpConfigYaml?, manifestYaml?, filePaths}    — 1-2 files: btp-automation/config/&lt;slug&gt;/btp_config.yaml (+ optional apps/&lt;slug&gt;/manifest.yml)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="673" width="1940" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
